{"pageid": 331, "title": "Slaughterverse", "revid": 2928, "categories": ["Comics", "Slaughterverse Wiki"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 300px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/25/Slaughterverse.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230228151514\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Slaughterverse\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"152\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Slaughterverse.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Slaughterverse.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/25/Slaughterverse.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20230228151514\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/25/Slaughterverse.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230228151514\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Slaughterverse\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/25/Slaughterverse.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20230228151514\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"152\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Slaughterverse.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Slaughterverse.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/25/Slaughterverse.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20230228151514\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Slaughterverse.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Slaughterverse</b><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>  is a comic book franchised created by <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> comprising <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> and its related spinoffs published by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Publication_history\">Publication history</span></h2>\n<p>The Slaughterverse began September 4, 2019, with the launch of the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series. The series was initially commissioned as a five-issue miniseries, but was later expanded to an ongoing series as the creators realized they had a much bigger story to tell, and the series proved to be popular.\n</p><p>In May 2021, <i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> spawned its first spinoff with the Free Comic Book Day issue <i><a href=\"/wiki/Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"Enter the House of Slaughter\">Enter the House of Slaughter</a></i>, which served as a teaser for the <i><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_(comic_series)\" title=\"House of Slaughter (comic series)\">House of Slaughter</a></i> series that launched the following October.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <i>House of Slaughter</i> introduced new writers and artists into the Slaughterverse while <i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> remained solely the domain of Tynion and Dell'Edera.\n</p><p>In December 2022, a one-shot comic titled <a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Book of Slaughter 1\"><i>Book of Slaughter</i> #1</a> was published focusing on <a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> It was followed by two other one-shots, <a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Butcher_1\" title=\"Book of Butcher 1\"><i>Book of Butcher</i> #1</a> in December 2023,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> and <a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Cutter_1\" title=\"Book of Cutter 1\"><i>Book of Cutter</i> #1</a> in December 2024.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Collectively, these three one-shots are called the <i>Books of Slaughter</i>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Slaughterverse_comics\"><i>Slaughterverse</i> comics</span></h3>\n<ul><li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> <small>(ongoing series, 2019–present)</small></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"Enter the House of Slaughter\">Enter the House of Slaughter</a></i> <small>(one-shot, 2021)</small></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_(comic_series)\" title=\"House of Slaughter (comic series)\">House of Slaughter</a></i> <small>(ongoing series, 2021–present)</small></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Book of Slaughter 1\">Book of Slaughter</a></i> <small>(one-shot, 2022)</small></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Butcher_1\" title=\"Book of Butcher 1\">Book of Butcher</a></i> <small>(one-shot, 2023)</small></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/A_Monster_Hunter_Walks_into_a_Bar\" title=\"A Monster Hunter Walks into a Bar\">A Monster Hunter Walks into a Bar</a></i> <small>(serialized short story, 2024)</small></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Cutter_1\" title=\"Book of Cutter 1\">Book of Cutter</a></i> <small>(one-shot, 2025)</small></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Swamp_Thing_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Swamp Thing Is Killing the Children 1\">Swamp Thing Is Killing the Children #1</a></i> <small>(one-shot, 2026)</small></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_(comic_series)\" title=\"Fall of the House of Slaughter (comic series)\">Fall of the House of Slaughter</a></i> <small>(upcoming mini-series)</small></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children:_Hope_is_a_Knife\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children: Hope is a Knife\">Something Is Killing the Children: Hope is a Knife</a></i> <small>(novel, 2026)</small></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Television_adaptation\">Television adaptation</span></h2>\n<p>A <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(TV_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (TV series)\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> adaptation for television</a> has been in development at <a href=\"/wiki/Netflix\" title=\"Netflix\">Netflix</a> since at least July 2021. Initially, the series was being developed by writers Trevor Macy and Mike Flanagan, however creative differences led to the project being shelved and Netflix parting ways with the duo.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> On February 23, 2023, Netflix announced that <a href=\"/wiki/Baran_bo_Odar\" title=\"Baran bo Odar\">Baran bo Odar</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Jantje_Friese\" title=\"Jantje Friese\">Jantje Friese</a>, the creators behind <i><a href=\"https://dark-netflix.fandom.com/wiki/Dark\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dark-netflix:Dark\">Dark</a></i> and <i><a href=\"https://1899-netflix.fandom.com/wiki/1899_(TV_series)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:1899-netflix:1899 (TV series)\">1899</a></i>, had been tapped to lead the series.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"74eac2651289159e0aacc8420944ec93\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:249px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1_Cover-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:247px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1_Cover.jpg\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1 Cover.jpg (1.6 MB)\" style=\"height:247px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/e/e8/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230225202450\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1 Cover.jpg (1.6 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Something Is Killing the Children\" height=\